{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "So that's it from us for this game. We hope you enjoyed our coverage. Australia will feel that they have got out of jail while New Zealand will think that had the rain not come in, they would have won the game. Nothing can be changed now though. Time to move on, Sri Lanka will take on South Africa tomorrow for a game at 1030 local (0930 GMT) at The Oval. Do join us for all the action. Until then, it's goodbye and take care!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "So the thing we feared the most has happened, this game has BEEN ABANDONED DUE TO RAIN which means New Zealand and Australia will be sharing a point each for this match. The Kiwis will be really disappointed as they were looking really charged up in the second innings. Australia on the other hand, will be thanking the rain gods for saving them as it would have been a tough task for them after struggling at 53/3 when the rains stopped play.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1820 local time - The rain is getting even more heavier and the possibility of the game starts fading every passing moment. For the game to resume at 1848, the shower needs to stop in about 10 minutes from now. So by all means, we are unlikely to have a game here.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "If this is reduced to a 20-over bash, Australia will need to chase down a target of 174. And that looks tough at the moment. Let's see. Stay tuned for more updates.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1755 local time - And the players are walking back to the dressing rooms with Moises Henriques. Australia are now 3 down for 53. The chase is only going to get trickier from hereon. For that though, they will need the rain to stop. And now, maybe, they might be wishing for a heavy shower. 1848 is the cut-off time for the 20-over game. So let's keep our fingers crossed.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "OUT! Milne bowls it outside off on a length, Henriques looks to defend but gets an inside edge onto his pads. The ball lobs back to the bowler and he takes it easily. That is a big wicket and the sight of Moises Henriques walking back to the hut with the rain falling just sums up Australia's chase so far. They are now too far behind in the game and only the rain gods can save them from hereon.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "4957", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Edged! Good length outside off, Henriques looks to defend but gets an outside edge wide of Ross Taylor at first slip. He dives to his right, looks to stop but then withdraws his hand for some reason. The ball runs down to the third man fence.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The second slip has been taken out and now we have only Ross Taylor standing at slip.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Hurls it outside off, Henriques comes forward and defends it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Steven Smith was looking to walk off with the rain falling, only to be called back by the umpire.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Moises gets across and defends it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "FOUR! Good shot! Shorter in length outside off, Henriques gets on top of it, controls his pull through backward square leg for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Edged! Fuller outside off, Henriques looks to drive but gets an outside edge which rolls towards the keeper.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Dug in half way down the track, Henriques tucks it towards fine leg for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "45/2", "Over": "8", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4957", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "10", "Balls": "8", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4308", "Runs": "8", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4338", "Overs": "4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "28", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "FOUR! Handsome strike! Slants it on a shorter length again, Henriques this time is in control of his short-arm jab through mid-wicket for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Slants it across on a length, Moises looks to defend but is beaten all ends up.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "FOUR! Top edged! Shorter in length, Henriques goes for the pull but gets a top edge. The ball flies over the head of the keeper for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Simon Doull on air mentions that the Kiwi bowlers have bowled a lot more short balls and not allowed the Australians to go through. In the meanwhile, the rain just gets harder.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Slants it across on a length, Henriques lets it go through.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Shorter in length just outside off, Henriques defends it watchfully.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Powerplay 2 has been signaled. Now a maximum of four fielder are allowed outside the circle till the 27th over.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4308", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Smith looks to drive it through covers but finds the fielder inside the ring.", "Summary": {"Score": "36/2", "Over": "7", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4308", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4957", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11933", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A mini-conference between Southee, Williamson and the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Hurls it outside off, Henriques comes forward to defend but gets an inside edge towards the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4957", "Commentary": "Good length outside off, Henriques looks to defend but is beaten all ends up.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Moises Henriques is the new man in.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "OUT! Finch throws it away! Milne angles it on a length, Finch looks to clip it over mid-wicket but does not find the gap. The ball just lobs to Taylor at short mid-wicket who takes the catch easily. Smith is not happy with that but Finch has to walk back and with the rain falling, it is only going to make things harder.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "4196", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Length outside off, Finch gets a bottom edge as he looks to punch it down the ground.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A slight drizzle is back there. That is surely not something we want again.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11933", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Good length outside off, Finch mistimes his punch to short extra cover.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Adam Milne is introduced into the attack.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4308", "Commentary": "FOUR! Top shot! Boult angles it outside off on a good length, Smith stands tall again and crunches it through covers for a boundary.", "Summary": {"Score": "35/1", "Over": "6", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4308", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4196", "Runs": "8", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4338", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4308", "Commentary": "Boult goes over the wicket, hurls it on a length on the stumps, Smith shuffles and looks to clip it through but fails to connect. A stifled appeal turned down.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4308", "Commentary": "Shorter length outside off, Smith looks to pull it over the leg side but fails to connect.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4308", "Commentary": "FOUR! Much, much, much better! Boult bowls it on a length outside off, Smith stands tall and punches it through covers for a boundary. Nice way to get off the mark.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4308", "Commentary": "Shorter length outside off, Smith looks to spank it through covers but fails to connect. Strange choice of shot, maybe the pressure of the chase?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Steven Smith will bat at number 3! Can he guide his team home on his 28th birthday?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "OUT! Edged and gone! Shorter length outside off, Warner looks to go big coming down the wicket. He only manages to get a thick outside edge and Luke Ronchi accepts the catch with glee. Boult performs his best against Australia and he has begun well here. He has taken 25 wickets in 10 games against them.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "5380", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Good length on off, Finch defends it from his crease.", "Summary": {"Score": "27/0", "Over": "5", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4196", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "5380", "Runs": "18", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4235", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Cutter this time from Southee at 117 kph, Warner taps it towards covers for a single. Smart batting.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "SIX! BOOM! Shorter and just around off, Warner does not miss out and carves it over point for a maximum. Both his feet were off the ground when he played that shot but got superb connection. Shikhar Dhawan from India, plays that shot a lot. It was also in the Champions Trophy 2013 that he announced himself with the shot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A comparatively slow start from the Australian openers. Even the outfield is not supporting them well as it has slowed down a bit.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Cuts this one towards backward point for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Bowls it outside off, Finch throws the kitchen sink at it but misses. Finch screams in pain and holds his left hamstring. Australia would hope that he is fit enough to last the tournament.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Finch punches this one towards point from his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The floodlights have been turned on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Outside off, left alone by Warner.", "Summary": {"Score": "19/0", "Over": "4", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "5380", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "11", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4196", "Runs": "7", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4338", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Finch punches this one through covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Warner turns it towards the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Edged! Length ball outside off, Finch looks to drive but gets an inside edge toward short fine leg where the fielder stops it with a dive. A single taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "There is a difference in the approach by both the batsmen there out in the middle and that is pointed out by the Ricky Ponting on air. David Warner stays forward and looks to impose himself on the bowling. Aaron Finch, on the other hand, makes the full use of his crease, stays back and then looks to attack the bowling.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Length ball around off, Finch looks to go straight but the ball goes off the inner half over mid on. The ball plugs in the outfield. Two runs taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Boult goes around the wicket, angles it on a good length, Finch looks to flay it away but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Slants it on off, Finch eases it down to long on for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "14/0", "Over": "3", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4196", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "3", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "5380", "Runs": "10", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4235", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Angles it on a length just around off, Finch punches it hard into the wicket. The ball bounces over the bowler but the mid off fielder cuts it off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Back of a length outside off, Finch taps it towards point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Square leg goes back now.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Shorter in length outside off, Finch looks to clear England with his pull but fails to put bat to ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Another one on the pads, Warner this time tucks it off his pads towards backward square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Slants it on the pads, Finch fails to clip it neatly. The ball rolls off the pads towards the leg side for a leg bye.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A short cover is in place now.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Back of a length outside off, Finch taps it to covers and takes off. Santner fields the ball and fires a throw at the bowler's end but misses. Finch had made it in though.", "Summary": {"Score": "11/0", "Over": "2", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4196", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "2", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "5380", "Runs": "9", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4338", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Edged! Outside off on a good length, Warner looks to defend but is taken back by the bounce. He gets it towards covers off the edge for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Lands it outside off, Warner pushes it back down the wicket.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Back of a length on the stumps, Warner tucks it towards the leg side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The second slip fielder moves out of the slip cordon.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "FOUR! Poor ball! On the pads, Warner tucks it to the fine leg fence for a boundary. Easy runs, these.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Shorter in length just outside off, Warner looks to pull it but gets an inside edge onto his body. He wants a single but is sent back in time.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Trent Boult to bowl from the other end with the second new ball. He has two slips in place.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Warner taps this one towards covers for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "5/0", "Over": "1", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "5380", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4196", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4235", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Shorter in length but on middle and leg, Warner goes for the pull but seems to have missed it. The players appeal but the umpire says no. Interestingly, he did not signal it a wide as well.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Outside off on a good length, Warner taps it towards the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "4196", "Commentary": "Slants it on the stumps, clipped through square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Close! Too full on the stumps, Warner clips it past the short mid-wicket fielder. The timing is good and they get three runs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Southee sprays it wide outside off, Warner comes down the wicket but lets the ball go through safely.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "It's time for the chase! The two Australian openers are David Warner and Aaron Finch. New Zealand begin the proceedings with Tim Southee. A slip in place. Here we go...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 76, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:13:53 AM"}}}